OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for new home for children
OL,4,Awith autism
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community interest company has lodged
OL,7,Fplans to open a new residential care
OL,8,Fhome for children with autism and
OL,9,Fadditional needs.
OL,11,FInclude In Autism wants to convert a
OL,12,Fvacant property off Queen Alexandra
OL,13,FRoad in Ashbrooke, Sunderland.
OL,15,FThe Ofsted-regulated facility for up to
OL,16,Ftwo children aged five to 17 would
OL,17,Foperate on a 24-hour basis and have
OL,18,Fdedicated staffing.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
